<http://www.orpha.net/ORDO/Orphanet_557493> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A clinical entity characterised by a set of homogeneous phenotypic abnormalities and evolution allowing a definitive clinical diagnosis." .
<http://www.orpha.net/ORDO/Orphanet_557493> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Native BioPortal hierarchy: ORDO" .
<http://www.orpha.net/ORDO/Orphanet_557493> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.orpha.net/ORDO/Orphanet_557493> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Disorder" .
